bai (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add Arch Linux and Debian packaging layouts under pkg/.
  * Add Justfile release helpers for source snapshots and package builds.
  * Publish bai as version 0.2.0.
  * Optional clipboard integration remains external: install `xclip`
    or `wl-clipboard` if you want automatic copy-to-clipboard support.

